            <value>At 6:08 p.m. Central Standard Time Friday, Environment Canada has ended a tornado warning for South Central Saskatchewan.  Aberdeen, Alvena, Wakaw, Vonda, Bruno, Colonsay and Viscount. Tornadoes associated with this alert are no longer expected in the area. </value>
